ices of [[Cookbook:Bread|bread]]\n*7–8 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n*1 stick [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], melted\n*2 cups [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]] [[Cookbook:Ham|ham]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] prepared [[Cookbook:Mustard|mustard]]\n*2 cups [[Cookbook:Grating|grated]] [[cookbook:Velveeta|Velveeta cheese]]\n*1 dash each of [[cookbook:Red Pepper|red pepper]], [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]], and [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] powder\n\n==Procedure==\n#Put bread in a greased 9 x 13-inch pan.\n#[[cookbook:Mix|Mix]] melted butter, milk, seasonings, and beaten eggs.\n#Pour mixture over bread.\n#Sprinkle with diced ham and top with grated cheese.\n#Refrigerate overnight.\n#[[cookbook:Bake|Bake]] for 1 hour at [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|350°F]].\n\n[[Category:Recipes for casserole|Egg Casserole]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ham|Egg Casserole]]\n[[Category:Recipes using processed cheese]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread]]\n[[Category:Recipes using milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using prepared mustard]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Egg Casserole","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"8 slices of bread","sourceText":"8 slices of bread","amountText":"8 slices of bread","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"7–8 eggs","sourceText":"7–8 eggs","amountText":"7–8 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 cups milk","sourceText":"2 cups milk","amountText":"2 cups milk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 stick butter, melted","sourceText":"1 stick butter, melted","amountText":"1 stick butter, melted","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":nul